  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Ben. I learn in the computer room. It is a big room. I see ten brown desks. I see ten blue chairs. I see ten computers. The computers are black. I like it.",
      "Look at my desk. It has a keyboard. The keyboard is black. A pen is on the desk. The pen is white. It has a gray ruler. I see a clock on the wall. The clock is red and white. Is it a new clock? I like my desk.",
      "Teacher Kim says, \"Look at the computer.\" Mia asks, \"Which one is mine?\" \"Find your name,\" says Teacher Kim. I find my name. It is on yellow paper. My computer is number five. I sit on the blue chair. I write my name. Today we learn the keyboard. It is fun. I smile."
    ],
    "summary": "Ben tells us about the computer room at his school. He names the things in the room and gives their colors and numbers.",
